++ * Cycle length statistics and next-period window estimation ported from:
++ *   drip by Bloody Health (https://gitlab.com/bloodyhealth/drip)
++ *   Files: src/lib/cycle.js, src/lib/cycle-length.js
++ *   Commit: 04e14cf526ec3480e64992484678455838603b81
++ *   License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
